## 7. Earning from ads and other models

You can layer monetization once you have stable traffic:  

- **Programmatic ads:**  
  - Standard display ads (Google AdSense or similar) in feed and story pages; keep them light so they don’t destroy low‑bandwidth UX.  
- **Direct sponsorships:**  
  - Category‑specific sponsorship (e.g., “AI section powered by X,” “Sports powered by Y”).  
- **Premium tier (later):**  
  - Ad‑free experience, deeper personalization, historical search across years (backed by APIs like NewsData.io which store 6+ years of news). [newsdata](https://newsdata.io)
  - Priority alerts and custom “watch lists” (e.g., “only EV/AI policy and startup funding news”).  
- **Data & insights:**  
  - Anonymized trend dashboards for B2B clients (e.g., brands wanting to monitor news volume around topics).  

Given your background, a **B2B insights dashboard** later could be a strong second product.

